<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27730" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διψ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, used
		as fem. of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψιος, βοτάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					141
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					3.3.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				4.322
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>venomous serpent, whose bite caused intense
				thirst,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				334
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>NA</u>
				6.51
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἔχιδνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.172
				</span></i>
			 (Antip. Sid.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.620.4
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Argos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἄκανθα</span> a desert <i>thorn,
				Acacia tortilis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.7.1
			</span></i>.</div>
